  <description>
    <p>
      rog-helper is a Linux-native control surface for ASUS ROG laptops with a
      GTK4/libadwaita desktop UI, a user-session daemon, and a diagnostics CLI.
    </p>
    <p>
      The current release integrates with asusd, supergfxd, UPower, hwmon,
      CPU sysfs, keyboard backlight sysfs, power-supply sysfs, memory telemetry,
      and an NVIDIA read-only fallback.
    </p>
  </description>
